     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">Hi all,<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"> </font><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">My structural model is returning me a warning message that “not\r\nall elements of the gradient are (near) zero; the optimizer may not have found\r\na local solution.” I’m wondering if someone can explain what this means and how\r\nto tackle the issue.<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"> </font><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">My data is collected across 4 times and has ~1500 participants.\r\nMy predictor variables include participant self-reports on eight items and third-person\r\nreports on four items. The measurement model revealed that a hierarchical model\r\nwith two latent variables (one for self-reports and the other for\r\nother-reports) is the best fit of the data, with CFI=0.949, TLI=0.955,\r\nRMSEA=0.022, SRMR=0.052. <u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"> </font><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">Below is my syntax for the structural model, with paths specified:\r\n<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"> </font><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">structural_model &lt;- &#39;<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"> </font><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"># IV over time<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">selflatent1 =~ self1_t1 + a2*self2_t1 + a3*self3_t1 +\r\na4*self4_t1 + a5*self5_t1 + a6*self6_t1 + a7*self7r_t1 + a8*self8r_t1<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">selflatent2 =~ self1_t2 + a2*self2_t2 + a3*self3_t2 +\r\na4*self4_t2 + a5*self5_t2 + a6*self6_t2 + a7*self7r_t2 + a8*self8r_t2<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">selflatent3 =~ self1_t3 + a2*self2_t3 + a3*self3_t3 +\r\na4*self4_t3 + a5*self5_t3 + a6*self6_t3 + a7*self7r_t3 + a8*self8r_t3<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">selflatent4 =~ self1_t4 + a2*self2_t4 + a3*self3_t4 +\r\na4*self4_t4 + a5*self5_t4 + a6*self6_t4 + a7*self7r_t4 + a8*self8r_t4<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"> </font><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">otherlatent1 =~ other1_t1 + b2*other2_t1 + b3*other3_t1 +\r\nb4*other4_t1<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">otherlatent2 =~ other1_t2 + b2*other2_t2 + b3*other3_t2 +\r\nb4*other4_t2<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">otherlatent3 =~ other1_t3 + b2*other2_t3 + b3*other3_t3 +\r\nb4*other4_t3<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">otherlatent4 =~ other1_t4 + b2*other2_t4 + b3*other3_t4 +\r\nb4*other4_t4<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"> </font><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"># Add hierarchy: Constrain both factor loadings to 1 since\r\nthere are only two first-order factors<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">latent1 =~ 1*selflatent1 + 1*otherlatent1<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">latent2 =~ 1*selflatent2 + 1*otherlatent2<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">latent3 =~ 1*selflatent3 + 1*otherlatent3<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">latent4 =~ 1*selflatent4 + 1*otherlatent4<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"> </font><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"># Add paths<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">dv1_t2 ~ dv1_t1 +\r\nlatent1<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">latent2 ~ latent1 +\r\ndv1_t1<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">dv1_t3 ~ dv1_t2 +\r\nlatent2<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">latent3 ~ latent2 +\r\ndv1_t2<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">dv1_t4 ~ dv1_t3 +\r\nlatent3<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">latent4 ~ latent3 +\r\ndv1_t3<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"> </font><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"># Allow same indicators over time to covary<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">self1_t1 ~~ self1_t2 + self1_t3 + self1_t4<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">self1_t2 ~~ self1_t3 + self1_t4<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">self1_t3 ~~ self1_t4<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"> </font><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">self2_t1 ~~ self2_t2 + self2_t3 + self2_t4<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">self2_t2 ~~ self2_t3 + self2_t4<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">self2_t3 ~~ self2_t4<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"> </font><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">self3_t1 ~~ self3_t2 + self3_t3 + self3_t4<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">self3_t2 ~~ self3_t3 + self3_t4<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">self3_t3 ~~ self3_t4<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"> </font><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">self4_t1 ~~ self4_t2 + self4_t3 + self4_t4<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">self4_t2 ~~ self4_t3 + self4_t4<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">self4_t3 ~~ self4_t4<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"> </font><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">self5_t1 ~~ self5_t2 + self5_t3 + self5_t4<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">self5_t2 ~~ self5_t3 + self5_t4<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">self5_t3 ~~ self5_t4<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"> </font><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">self6_t1 ~~ self6_t2 + self6_t3 + self6_t4<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">self6_t2 ~~ self6_t3 + self6_t4<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">self6_t3 ~~ self6_t4<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"> </font><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">self7r_t1 ~~ self7r_t2 + self7r_t3 + self7r_t4 + self8r_t1 +\r\nself8r_t2 + self8r_t3 + self8r_t4<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">self7r_t2 ~~ self7r_t3 + self7r_t4 + self8r_t1 + self8r_t2 +\r\nself8r_t3 + self8r_t4<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">self7r_t3 ~~ self7r_t4 + self8r_t1 + self8r_t2 + self8r_t3 +\r\nself8r_t4<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">self7r_t4 ~~ self8r_t1 + self8r_t2 + self8r_t3 + self8r_t4<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"> </font><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">self8r_t1 ~~ self8r_t2 + self8r_t3 + self8r_t4<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">self8r_t2 ~~ self8r_t3 + self8r_t4<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">self8r_t3 ~~ self8r_t4<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"> </font><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"># Allow same &quot;other&quot; rater scores over time to\r\ncovary<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">other1_t1 ~~ other1_t2<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">other1_t3 ~~ other1_t4<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"> </font><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">other2_t1 ~~ other2_t2<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">other2_t3 ~~ other2_t4<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"> </font><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">other3_t1 ~~ other3_t2<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">other3_t3 ~~ other3_t4<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"> </font><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">other4_t1 ~~ other4_t2<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">other4_t3 ~~ other4_t4<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"> </font><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"># Allow same latent over time to covary<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">selflatent1 ~~ selflatent2 + selflatent3 + selflatent4<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">selflatent2 ~~ selflatent3 + selflatent4<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">selflatent3 ~~ selflatent4<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"> </font><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">otherlatent1 ~~ otherlatent2 + otherlatent3 + otherlatent4<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">otherlatent2 ~~ otherlatent3 + otherlatent4<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">otherlatent3 ~~ otherlatent4<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"> </font><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"># Allow same dependent variable over time to covary<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">dv1_t1 ~~ dv1_t2 + dv1_t3 + dv1_t4<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">dv1_t2 ~~ dv1_t3 + dv1_t4<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">dv1_t3 ~~ dv1_t4<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">&#39;<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"> </font><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">The model converged but I’m not sure if the output is reliable\r\ngiven the warning message. I also got an unexpectedly large estimate of dv1_t2\r\npredicting dv1_t3 (b=12.826, but my DV is on a scale of 0-1). Can anyone\r\nexplain what this warning message means, and what can be done to potentially tackle\r\nthe problem? When I investigated “optim.gradient”, below were the elements that\r\nhad non-zero gradient:<u></u><u></u></font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><u></u><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"> </font><u></u></p>\r\n\r\n<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"572\" style=\"width:429pt;border-collapse:collapse;border-width:initial;border-style:none\">\r\n <tbody><tr style=\"height:16.0pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"191\" nowrap valign=\"top\" style=\"width:143pt;border-width:1pt;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(191,191,191);padding:0in 5.4pt;height:16pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">dv1_t2~~dv1_t1<u></u><u></u></font></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"191\" nowrap valign=\"top\" style=\"width:143pt;border-top:1pt solid rgb(191,191,191);border-right:1pt solid rgb(191,191,191);border-bottom:1pt solid rgb(191,191,191);border-left-width:initial;border-left-style:none;padding:0in 5.4pt;height:16pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">dv1_t3~~dv1_t1<u></u><u></u></font></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"191\" nowrap valign=\"top\" style=\"width:143pt;border-top:1pt solid rgb(191,191,191);border-right:1pt solid rgb(191,191,191);border-bottom:1pt solid rgb(191,191,191);border-left-width:initial;border-left-style:none;padding:0in 5.4pt;height:16pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">dv1_t4~~dv1_t1<u></u><u></u></font></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"height:16.0pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"191\" nowrap valign=\"top\" style=\"width:143pt;border-right:1pt solid rgb(191,191,191);border-bottom:1pt solid rgb(191,191,191);border-left:1pt solid rgb(191,191,191);border-top-width:initial;border-top-style:none;padding:0in 5.4pt;height:16pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">0.04<u></u><u></u></font></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"191\" nowrap valign=\"top\" style