   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(53,53,53)\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">Hi Dr. Jorgensen,<u></u><u></u></font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(53,53,53)\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"> </font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(53,53,53)\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">Thank you for your suggestions. Here is what my model-implied\r\ncorrelation matrix looks like (obtained by <i>lavInspect(fit, &quot;cor.all&quot;</i>)):<u></u><u></u></font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(53,53,53)\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"> </font></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a style=\"clear:left;margin-bottom:1em;margin-right:1em;float:left\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/lavaan/attach/1b99fa7eea744/Screen%20Shot%202019-09-02%20at%2011.55.12%20AM.png?part=0.1&amp;view=1\" alt=\"Screen Shot 2019-09-02 at 11.55.12 AM.png\" width=\"320\" height=\"94\" border=\"0\"></a></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(53,53,53)\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"><br></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(53,53,53)\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"><br></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(53,53,53)\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"><br></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(53,53,53)\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"><br></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(53,53,53)\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"><br></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(53,53,53)\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"><br></font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(53,53,53)\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">When I tried what you suggested (running two separate models --\r\none predicting dv with the first-order&quot;self&quot; and the other predicting\r\ndv with the first-order &quot;other&quot; -- instead of creating the\r\nsecond-order &quot;latent&quot;), I received a different warning message that\r\nthe variance-covariance of the estimated parameters does not appear to be\r\npositive definite and the smallest eigenvector is close to zero. <u></u><u></u></font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(53,53,53)\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"> </font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(53,53,53)\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">Would be very grateful to hear your thoughts on what else I can\r\ntry.</font><font face=\"AppleSystemUIFont\"><u></u><u></u></font></span></p></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:2.0pt;text-autospace:none\"><br></p>\r\n\r\n<br>On Monday, September 2, 2019 at 4:07:28 AM UTC-4, Terrence Jorgensen wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">Can anyone\r\nexplain what this warning message means</font></p></div></blockquote><div><br></div><div>It means your model might not have converged on a good solution, only a &quot;local maximum&quot; (or the algorithm may have simply stopped looking because the gradient didn&#39;t point out any obvious place to look next). </div><div><br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"> When I investigated “optim.gradient”, below were the elements that\r\nhad non-zero gradient:</font></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"> </font></p>\r\n\r\n<table border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"572\" style=\"width:429pt;border-collapse:collapse;border-width:initial;border-style:none\">\r\n <tbody><tr style=\"height:16.0pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"191\" nowrap valign=\"top\" style=\"width:143pt;border-width:1pt;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(191,191,191);padding:0in 5.4pt;height:16pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">dv1_t2~~dv1_t1</font></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"191\" nowrap valign=\"top\" style=\"width:143pt;border-top:1pt solid rgb(191,191,191);border-right:1pt solid rgb(191,191,191);border-bottom:1pt solid rgb(191,191,191);border-left-width:initial;border-left-style:none;padding:0in 5.4pt;height:16pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">dv1_t3~~dv1_t1</font></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"191\" nowrap valign=\"top\" style=\"width:143pt;border-top:1pt solid rgb(191,191,191);border-right:1pt solid rgb(191,191,191);border-bottom:1pt solid rgb(191,191,191);border-left-width:initial;border-left-style:none;padding:0in 5.4pt;height:16pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">dv1_t4~~dv1_t1</font></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"height:16.0pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"191\" nowrap valign=\"top\" style=\"width:143pt;border-right:1pt solid rgb(191,191,191);border-bottom:1pt solid rgb(191,191,191);border-left:1pt solid rgb(191,191,191);border-top-width:initial;border-top-style:none;padding:0in 5.4pt;height:16pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">0.04</font></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"191\" nowrap valign=\"top\" style=\"width:143pt;border-top-width:initial;border-style:none solid solid none;border-left-width:initial;border-bottom-width:1pt;border-bottom-color:rgb(191,191,191);border-right-width:1pt;border-right-color:rgb(191,191,191);padding:0in 5.4pt;height:16pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">0.003</font></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"191\" nowrap valign=\"top\" style=\"width:143pt;border-top-width:initial;border-style:none solid solid none;border-left-width:initial;border-bottom-width:1pt;border-bottom-color:rgb(191,191,191);border-right-width:1pt;border-right-color:rgb(191,191,191);padding:0in 5.4pt;height:16pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">-0.002</font></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"height:16.0pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"191\" nowrap valign=\"top\" style=\"width:143pt;border-right:1pt solid rgb(191,191,191);border-bottom:1pt solid rgb(191,191,191);border-left:1pt solid rgb(191,191,191);border-top-width:initial;border-top-style:none;padding:0in 5.4pt;height:16pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">dv1_t2~~dv1_t3</font></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"191\" nowrap valign=\"top\" style=\"width:143pt;border-top-width:initial;border-style:none solid solid none;border-left-width:initial;border-bottom-width:1pt;border-bottom-color:rgb(191,191,191);border-right-width:1pt;border-right-color:rgb(191,191,191);padding:0in 5.4pt;height:16pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">dv1_t2~~dv1_t4</font></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"191\" nowrap valign=\"top\" style=\"width:143pt;border-top-width:initial;border-style:none solid solid none;border-left-width:initial;border-bottom-width:1pt;border-bottom-color:rgb(191,191,191);border-right-width:1pt;border-right-color:rgb(191,191,191);padding:0in 5.4pt;height:16pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">dv1_t2~~dv1_t2</font></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"height:16.0pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"191\" nowrap valign=\"top\" style=\"width:143pt;border-right:1pt solid rgb(191,191,191);border-bottom:1pt solid rgb(191,191,191);border-left:1pt solid rgb(191,191,191);border-top-width:initial;border-top-style:none;padding:0in 5.4pt;height:16pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">-0.003</font></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"191\" nowrap valign=\"top\" style=\"width:143pt;border-top-width:initial;border-style:none solid solid none;border-left-width:initial;border-bottom-width:1pt;border-bottom-color:rgb(191,191,191);border-right-width:1pt;border-right-color:rgb(191,191,191);padding:0in 5.4pt;height:16pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">0.002</font></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"191\" nowrap valign=\"top\" style=\"width:143pt;border-top-width:initial;border-style:none solid solid none;border-left-width:initial;border-bottom-width:1pt;border-bottom-color:rgb(191,191,191);border-right-width:1pt;border-right-color:rgb(191,191,191);padding:0in 5.4pt;height:16pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">-0.016</font></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"height:16.0pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"191\" nowrap valign=\"top\" style=\"width:143pt;border-right:1pt solid rgb(191,191,191);border-bottom:1pt solid rgb(191,191,191);border-left:1pt solid rgb(191,191,191);border-top-width:initial;border-top-style:none;padding:0in 5.4pt;height:16pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">dv1_t1~~dv1_t1</font></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"191\" nowrap valign=\"top\" style=\"width:143pt;border-top-width:initial;border-style:none solid solid none;border-left-width:initial;border-bottom-width:1pt;border-bottom-color:rgb(191,191,191);border-right-width:1pt;border-right-color:rgb(191,191,191);padding:0in 5.4pt;height:16pt\"></td>\r\n  <td width=\"191\" nowrap valign=\"top\" style=\"width:143pt;border-top-width:initial;border-style:none solid solid none;border-left-width:initial;border-bottom-width:1pt;border-bottom-color:rgb(191,191,191);border-right-width:1pt;border-right-color:rgb(191,191,191);padding:0in 5.4pt;height:16pt\"></td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"height:16.0pt\">\r\n  <td width=\"191\" nowrap valign=\"top\" style=\"width:143pt;border-right:1pt solid rgb(191,191,191);border-bottom:1pt solid rgb(191,191,191);border-left:1pt solid rgb(191,191,191);border-top-width:initial;border-top-style:none;padding:0in 5.4pt;height:16pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">-0.025</font></span></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"191\" nowrap valign=\"top\" style=\"width:143pt;border-top-width:initial;border-style:none solid solid none;border-left-width:initial;border-bottom-width:1pt;border-bottom-color:rgb(191,191,191);border-right-width:1pt;border-right-color:rgb(191,191,191);padding:0in 5.4pt;height:16pt\"></td>\r\n  <td width=\"191\" nowrap valign=\"top\" style=\"width:143pt;border-top-width:initial;border-style:none solid solid none;border-left-width:initial;border-bottom-width:1pt;border-bottom-color:rgb(191,191,191);border-right-width:1pt;border-right-color:rgb(191,191,191);padding:0in 5.4pt;height:16pt\"></td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"> </font></p></div></blockquote><div><br></div><div>All these are about your dv* variables.  What does their correlation matrix look like? </div><div><br></div><div>Does this continue to occur when you treat self and other as separate outcomes instead of trying to extract a higher-order common factor &quot;latent&quot;?</div><div><br></div><div><div><div>Terrence D. Jorgensen</div><div>Assistant Professor, Methods and Statistics</div><div>Research Institute for Child Development and Education, the University of Amsterdam</div><div><a href=\"http://www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen\" style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792423049679000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3QhlxpUHlLKRCO9OaBCCzl\">http://www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen</a></div></div><div><br></div></div></div></blockquote></div>"
